Cell["\<\
Useful when an already-built diagram should be treated as an atomic process \
\[LongDash] for example, to display it as a single box rather than \
decomposed, or to compose it with others without exposing its substructure.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5ad4624e-2e9b-46a8-b94e-4f8bf2a62ef5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The wrapped diagram preserves its data and behaviour under composition, but \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DiagramDecompose"]], 
    "paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramDecompose", 
    "Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "df517da2-58ca-430d-bd0e-2fd888a21be0"],
 " and surgery tools see it as a single node."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a497a728-37e8-47fc-9bc2-54d25ce3d700"]
}, Open  ]],

